Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱里有个笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this cage in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法被关在里面  我也曾被关在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's where they keep Lucifer, and I've been in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝好像想让我回到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think god wants me to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入你头脑的并不是上帝  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't God inside your head, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟在地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's in hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗  她可是万物的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness, she's the end of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以打败她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和路西法一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}...With Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.65,0:00:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不  -B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的能打败她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you really beat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我可以  -那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can. - Then, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗  她对你来说算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness, what is she to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远不会伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是联系在一起的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bound, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我告诉过你  -我们会永远联系在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you. - We'll always be bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不可抗拒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be resisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我在一起时  就会有的感觉  是极乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That feeling that you have when you're with me, just bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不想那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我将永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I will be together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.27,0:01:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(爱尔兰  科克郡  三十年前)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.11,0:01:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帕德里克  你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Padraic? Oh, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她喜欢这首歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loves this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有这个能哄她入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing that will put her to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.92,0:01:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.88,0:01:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的歌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our song.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你又笑了  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you smiling, mo chuisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.18,0:01:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力  莫拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying, Maura.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.22,0:01:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:01:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我听到了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尖叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}a scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撑着  帕德里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Padraic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把它从我脑袋里弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it out of my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.03,0:02:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.02,0:02:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be okay, sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be o...kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第11季第11集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥被困在炼狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your brother was trapped in purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你却在这儿泡妞  逗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were here with a girl and a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢不了了  萨姆  你不够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win this, Sam. You're just not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本没努力去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't even bother trying to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  如果你想击败黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know that if you're gonna beat the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.18,0:03:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得准备好看着你所爱的人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to be ready to watch the people you love die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.97,0:04:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你起来多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗  你好几天没出地堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure? 'cause you haven't left the bunker in days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  我好像找到件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good. 'cause I think I found us a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗德·米勒  65岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold Miller, 65.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.31,0:04:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,橡树公园养老院的住户\N{\fnArial\fs30}A resident of Oak Park, an old folks' home,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天被发现死在屋中  头被打碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}was found yesterday in his room with his head bashed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But get this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门紧锁  也没有闯入迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}the doors were locked and there was no sign of break-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼  恶魔附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost? Demonic possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得值得一看  你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure it's worth a look. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最棒的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and best part is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,橡树公园离这儿就15分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oak Park is 15 minutes from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在我们附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in our backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:04:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡怎么办  我们一直没他的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Cass? We haven't heard from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:05:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  阿玛拉没有丝毫消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, first of all, we've got zero on Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Cass... Cass will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一向都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全世界那么多公园\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the parks in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我偏偏选了个有天使的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I pick one with an angel in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.23,0:06:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你了  简直不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you. Couldn't believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.51,0:06:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, believe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里真美  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful out here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些你以为自己根本不会想念的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things you think you're not gonna miss at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果却是你最想念的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you end up missing the very, very most.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在赶紧享受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy it while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.06,0:06:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有恶意  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come in peace, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不是你的兄弟  路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not your brother, Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not looking for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我是击败黑暗的唯一希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I am your only hope at beating the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这帮熊孩子对她发起了攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}heard you kids had your big shot at the title,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果没得手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用害怕  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to be afraid, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经离开了那个讨厌的笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am out of that awful, awful cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来拯救你们所有人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm here to save you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战神路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer ex machina.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她无法被毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It cannot be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些基层天使啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the problem with you rank-and-file angels...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无远见\N{\fnArial\fs30}no vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(橡树公园退休之家  接送服务)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(橡树公园退休之家)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是个养老院\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is an old folks' home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(橡树公园退休之家  早鸟特价  今天就预定你的明天吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们该做个预约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we ought to make a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能活那么久还好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we should be so lucky to live long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟警察说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I told the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时经过哈罗德的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was walking by Harold's room,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到了很响的撞击声\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I heard a loud banging noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我还听到房间里的哈罗德大喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I heard Harold yell from inside of his suite,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.31,0:08:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"把它从我脑袋里弄出去"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Get it out of my head""
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就敲门喊他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I knocked on the door and called to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他没有回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he didn't reply,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就用了我的万能钥匙开门进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used my pass key to get into his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是看到了他  他躺着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I saw him. He was on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}His skull was, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正流了很多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, there was a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.07,0:08:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-当时房间里没有别人  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And nobody else was in the room. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门窗紧锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The windows and doors were locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还查了安保记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even checked the security logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整晚没人出入哈罗德的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody was in or out of Harold's room all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真不明白怎么会出这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really understand what could have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穆尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mildred.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早啊  亚瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good morning, Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是穆尔德  我们一位住户\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mildred, one of our residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你总工作到那么晚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, do you always work late at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我最近一直住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been, uh, staying here, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.81,0:09:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妻子离开了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.71,0:09:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是用短信分的手  能相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Via text, if you can believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一连串的表情符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}a whole series of emojis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可没忍着  以火攻火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I didn't stand for that. Unh-unh. Fought fire with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给她发了大粪符号表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent her the poop emoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's one way to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该发心的  我有时候好蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have sent the heart. I can be so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望她回我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish she'd call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  我觉得你做得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, I think you did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, hey, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由于你经常待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you've been staying here, uh, a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有注意到有什么奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, have you noticed any strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,声音  气味  或冷点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}sounds, smells, uh, cold spots?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  没有  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Uh, no. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是例行问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just routine questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敌人呢  哈罗德有什么敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, what about enemies? Harold have any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:09:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还有不少呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had quite a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.77,0:10:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗德在偷其他住户的伟哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out Harold was stealing the other residents' viagra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  真混"蛋"  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. A real dick move, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在他房间检测到了电磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I got an EMF hit in his room,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过几乎每层楼都能检测得到电磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I got an EMF hit on pretty much every floor in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里死过多少人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people died in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟  那个心碎的经理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur, the, uh... heartbroken manager,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他让我查看了所有的住户档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}he gave me access to all the residents' files.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是所有在这里去世的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is everyone who has passed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙  贾克·汤森  跟哈罗德有仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}this guy, Jake Townsend, had beef with Harold,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不是为了小蓝药丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it wasn't over blue pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贾克对哈罗德提出过正式投诉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake filed a formal complaint against Harold?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  据称哈罗德在偷他的养老金支票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, apparently Harold was stealing his pension checks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己去兑现\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cashing them for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贾克死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, when Jake died,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他家人向哈罗德发起了民事诉讼\N{\fnArial\fs30}his family filed a civil suit against Harold,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.73,0:11:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但结果在庭上纠缠\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it just got caught up in the courts
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并没能进行庭审\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never went to trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许贾克作为复仇怨魂回来纠缠\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe Jake stuck around as a vengeful spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己解决了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}took matters into his own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么贾克·汤森葬在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's Jake Townsend buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(贾克·汤森  挚爱的丈夫和父亲)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来吧  你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it. You're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不打算退休吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So no retirement, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你一直打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're the one who's always wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英勇就义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go out blaze of glory style...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好还有邦·乔维的音乐做背景乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preferably while the Bon Jovi song is playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是《风中之烛》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a candle in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但你说得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but the way you said it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像英勇就义\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was like that blaze of glory was gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会来得比较早\N{\fnArial\fs30}happen sooner rather than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:11:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  其实  我不好  很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not, actually. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.27,0:12:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再次接近路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being so close to Lucifer again, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我回想起好多\N{\fnArial\fs30}brought stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.03,0:12:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为已经忘记的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff I thought I forgot about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  路西法从未出过那个笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look. Lucifer is never getting out of that cage, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.27,0:12:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你是永远不会回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are never going back, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以这事到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...case closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个案子也结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so is this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.59,0:12:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又来查案感觉不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of nice being back on a case, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.47,0:12:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能换换心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your mind off of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧烧了骨头回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's burn the bones so we can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(橡树公园退休之家)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.77,0:12:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回头见  好\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you then. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想惹麻烦吗  小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You up to some trouble, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总是的  亚瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always, Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我们有备用发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. We've got backup generators.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不是吧  你真没听到吗  -没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? You can't hear that? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是有人在尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sounds like someone's screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把它从我脑袋里弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it out of my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟  我什么都没听到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur, I don't hear anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟说他听到了什么  像是尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Arthur said he heard something, like a scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did you hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hear a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能听到亚瑟拿脑袋撞碎玻璃窗的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the sound of Arthur bashing his head through that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只想让那声音停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just wanted that noise to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说  "把它从我脑袋里弄出去"\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "Get it out of my head."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还注意到别的了吗  气温下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice anything else, a drop in temperature?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  但断电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But the power went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.77,0:14:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从撞碎的窗户往外看时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I looked through the broken window,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,具体是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会相信我的  他们是没信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna believe me. They certainly didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道我看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是第一次接触这种东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't my first brush with something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我10年前就见过鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a ghost 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时也没人信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody believed me then, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们信你  贝克女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe you, Ms. Baker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥斯本探员  谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Osbourne, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有联调局在调查我觉得安全多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel so much safer knowing the FBI is looking into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得需要拿回我的手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna need my hand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝克女士  你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Baker, what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有长长的飘散的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long, flowing hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血红的袍子  深陷的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}blood-red robes, sunken eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且她在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and... and she was...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃亚瑟的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}feeding on Arthur's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. Um, excuse me one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别离开我  奥斯本探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't leave me, Agent Osbourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  我们不会离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛琳  特别探员巴特勒  联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marlene, Special Agent Butler, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know anything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚亚瑟的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what happened with Arthur last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我昨晚没来上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I wasn't working last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那哈罗德·米勒死的那晚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you working the night Harold Miller died?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  "谢谢"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um... "Thanks."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  当然  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, of course. Uh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就学过一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I only know a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大学时学过一点  过去好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I took some back in college, but that was a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大部分人连一点都不知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people don't know any.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate the trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should probably, uh, get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.31,0:16:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Uh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-证人吗  -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Witness? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  看来  不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, apparently, not a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:17:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  鬼是不会吃爆开的人脑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. Ghosts don't feed on busted-open heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去验尸官那里问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll check with the coroner,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看第一位被害人脑子里是否少了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if, uh, anything was missing from our first vic's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但愿是僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fingers crossed it's zombies,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就能《行尸走肉》一把了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can get our "Walking dead" on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(不管是什么  我们得查明白)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(赶在它下次进食之前)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.51,0:17:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了  好  再次感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got it. Okay, thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.65,0:17:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据验尸官说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, according to the coroner,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗德部分前额叶不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}part of Harold's frontal lobe was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这符合死亡女妖的特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that tracks with banshees.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banshees?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女妖不是好的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought banshees were good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仙女传说里的是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones tied to fairy lore are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的喊声是为警告那些将遭遇死亡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cry out as a warning to a victim's impending death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这些呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是坏死亡女妖  一群混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}are malevolent banshees... total dick bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们利用自己的尖叫逼疯猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use their piercing scream to drive their prey crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逼迫被害人自己撞破大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forces the vics to crack open their own eggs,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后死亡女妖就开吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the banshees feed on the yolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且只有被害人能听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and he only people who can hear the banshee's scream
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女妖的尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the vics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得穆尔德什么都没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that would explain why Mildred didn't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们能穿雾而行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and they, uh, travel through mist,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.55,0:18:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以就怪不得能进入哈罗德上锁的房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which explains how they got into Harold's locked room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们只以弱者为目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they only prey on the vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗德刚做过髋关节置换手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold did just have hip replacement surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟的妻子刚离开了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Arthur's wife just left him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broken heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也算是"弱"吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a kind of vulnerable, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在一个地带反复作案  直到全吃干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hunt the same place until it's picked clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.31,0:18:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且只晚上出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they only hunt at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们有几小时可以锁定下一个受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that just gives us a few hours to figure out who's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how do we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金刀  后箱里可没带这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold blade. I don't have any in the trunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.19,0:18:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我这就回地堡去拿几把来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I got to head back to the bunker and grab a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你留下  查明这里谁是"弱者"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here and figure out who in this place is vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.81,0:19:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们好几天没你的信儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't hear from you for days,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跑来  就搞个天翻地覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You show up, you start wrecking the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.63,0:19:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. W-what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在找一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm... looking for a spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把阿玛拉引出来  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}something to draw Amara out, but there's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都看到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had her in my sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她受伤了  我本该了结一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was hurt. I should have ended it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:19:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  但肯定应该有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know. But there has to be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还能得到几次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how many more chances are we gonna get?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说要下杀手是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying you're gonna kill is one thing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但真做又是另一回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually doing it's something totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有两次杀阿玛拉的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had two shots at Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两次都没得手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I struck out both times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.73,0:20:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道从何说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全都告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴特勒探员啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Agent Butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-请进吧  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, please, do come in. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的搭档呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's that partner of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他...就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he, um... he'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.34,0:20:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  那是很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.53,0:20:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(致敬佩茜·克莱恩)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时我还没这么好看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I got so good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.35,0:21:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-喝茶吗  -不用了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like some tea? - Uh, no, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.34,0:21:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝克女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Baker?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.73,0:21:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我穆尔德吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Mildred.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穆尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mildred.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须跟你说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和我搭档并非是联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner and I, we're not really FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是兄弟  我们是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're brothers, and we hunt monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.43,0:21:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道  我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你俩太帅了  根本不像联调局探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- you two are too cute to be FBI agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.35,0:21:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道我多年前看到的那个鬼是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew that damn ghost I saw years ago was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.70,0:21:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个像吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是个死亡女妖  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a banshee? - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女妖会对被害者尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banshees scream at their victims,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.86,0:21:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们自残  然后再去吃他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting them to harm themselves, and then they feed on their --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.65,0:21:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.65,0:21:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:21:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女妖捕食弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, banshees prey on the vulnerable,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我去查了所有的住户医疗记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I checked out all of the residents' medical records,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你患有心房纤颤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have an atrial fibrillation,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.21,0:22:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以用药物治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}which can be treated with meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这也意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it means that --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.87,0:22:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm vulnerable?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.75,0:22:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下一个就是我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I next?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和我哥哥不会让它得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother and I aren't gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.71,0:22:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会保护你的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna protect you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.85,0:22:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女妖只在夜晚捕猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, banshees only hunt at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你现在很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you're safe right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.59,0:22:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你趁现在多休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we really need you to try and get some rest while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会再过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识一位叫玛琳的清洁工吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know a housekeeper named Marlene?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.19,0:22:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是聋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.39,0:22:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们大概是弄错了名字吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe you got your names mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.41,0:22:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的确有位叫玛琳的员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one person on staff named Marlene,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她休假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she's on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.59,0:22:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴特勒探员  我孙女也是聋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Butler, my granddaughter is deaf,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真心需要练习手语\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I could really use some practice signing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真有员工是聋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if there is a staff member that's deaf,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.44,0:23:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我会很想跟他们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would love to talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.28,0:23:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So would I.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.25,0:24:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扮成联调局探员来掩盖你杀人的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Dressing up as FBI to cover up your kills?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.78,0:24:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是聪明呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.79,0:24:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还从没见过这么融入生活的死亡女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never met a banshee that could blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.29,0:24:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.86,0:24:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我读出你朋友的唇语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read your friend's lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.52,0:24:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该进食了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It's feeding time""
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.81,0:24:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  你弄错了  你弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, you're mixed up! You're mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.35,0:24:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是死亡女妖  我们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we're not banshees. We're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.24,0:24:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我哥  咱们追捕的是同一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my brother. W-we're all hunting the same thing here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.93,0:24:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a banshee.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.17,0:24:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿着血红长袍  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}In -- in blood red robes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.79,0:24:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.75,0:24:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你验证一下  试我一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, test me. Test me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.33,0:24:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.97,0:24:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.91,0:24:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.40,0:24:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.34,0:25:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾琳·莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen Leahy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.30,0:25:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们追捕的那个死亡女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The banshee you're hunting...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.99,0:25:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害死了我的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it killed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.35,0:25:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.39,0:25:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个猎人在婴儿床上发现了我  双耳流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hunter found me in my crib, ears bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.66,0:25:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉莲·奥格雷迪  这就是她的遗物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lillian O'Grady, this was hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.87,0:25:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一直在追捕那个死亡女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd been tracking the banshee.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但一直没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never found it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.34,0:25:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说莉莲养大了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Lillian raised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.32,0:25:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该说是训练了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like trained me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.31,0:25:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我16岁时她便去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died when I was 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.26,0:25:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎魔时牺牲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.64,0:25:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.09,0:25:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那之后你就一直一个人过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've been on your own ever since?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.52,0:25:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢单打独斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer working alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.41,0:25:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,信任问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.59,0:25:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.52,0:26:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你妈妈是猎人  还是女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, was your mom a hunter or a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.23,0:26:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  她父亲是个秘密组织的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Her father was part of this secret organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.24,0:26:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在已经没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's defunct now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.27,0:26:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记录者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men of letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.51,0:26:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.77,0:26:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.82,0:26:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.61,0:26:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跟你差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.08,0:26:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是传人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're legacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.32,0:26:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想杀了她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.67,0:26:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩似乎通过血印联系在了一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the two of you are connected somehow by the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.78,0:26:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, it's, uh... it's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.55,0:26:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,互相吸引吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attraction?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.13,0:26:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.20,0:26:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.11,0:26:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.09,0:26:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, a...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.59,0:26:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吸引  联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attraction, connection...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.14,0:26:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你讲  真的吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you, man, it scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.13,0:26:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我能不能阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that I can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.52,0:27:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道我能不能抗拒它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that I can resist it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.17,0:27:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it scares me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.16,0:27:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们会查个明白的  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we will find out what this is, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.25,0:27:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终这或许能帮我们引她出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end, it may help draw her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.06,0:27:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这或许是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.43,0:27:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -迪恩  查一下爱德华·德宾二世\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - Dean, look up Edward Durbin II.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.26,0:27:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-等一下  什么  -在记录者的档案里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. What? - In the men of letters' files.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.71,0:27:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  她没说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, son of a bitch. She ain't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.06,0:27:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据记录者的档案记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the men of letters' records,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.77,0:27:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱德华·德宾二世于1939年加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward Durbin II was inducted in 1939,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.10,0:27:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是被派往欧洲的一小支代表团的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}part of a small delegation that was sent to Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.06,0:27:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.86,0:27:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(另一个  我要了)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.60,0:27:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  她父亲当时刚失了业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, her father had just lost his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.64,0:27:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(高个子归你了)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.33,0:27:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他当时精神崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a nervous breakdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.46,0:27:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那他是弱者喽  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, he was vulnerable. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.18,0:27:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而她妈妈只知道一些基本的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her mom only knew some basic spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.49,0:27:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.71,0:27:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她用了一个咒驱逐了死亡女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used one to banish the banshee,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.78,0:27:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救了艾琳一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}saved Eileen's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.08,0:27:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们在追捕的死亡女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, the banshee we're hunting
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.27,0:28:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是杀了艾琳父母的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the same one that killed Eileen's parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.46,0:28:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.63,0:28:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.60,0:28:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  有什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.92,0:28:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要用艾琳用来困住我的那个凯尔特咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're gonna use the same Celtic spell eileen used to trap me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.64,0:28:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等今晚死亡女妖来找穆尔德时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the banshee comes for Mildred tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.30,0:28:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就困住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}we trap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.85,0:28:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后用金子杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we hit it with gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.12,0:28:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.00,0:28:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢把穆尔德当成诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like using Mildred as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.68,0:28:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在担心她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you worried about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.23,0:28:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是不是意味着她真有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does this mean she has a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.02,0:28:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我确实喜欢《黄金女郎》里的{\u1}布兰奇{\u0}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I always did have a thing for Blanche on "Golden girls."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.02,0:28:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.88,0:28:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.63,0:28:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别对自己不了解的东西评头论足  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't judge what you don't understand, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.05,0:28:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没在评头论足\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm -- I'm not judging.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是一直喜欢索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just always had a thing for Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.80,0:28:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I could see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.93,0:28:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不想把任何人当成诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't like using anyone as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.79,0:28:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们只能这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.01,0:28:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.16,0:28:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  我得赶回萨姆身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I got to get back to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.26,0:28:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我俩谈的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, about what we talked about,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.56,0:28:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们了解更多情况前...\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just keep that between you and me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.77,0:28:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先别和别人说  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}till we know more, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.23,0:28:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  那可不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, that's not --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.54,0:28:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  相信我就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, just...trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.22,0:28:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但下次你面对阿玛拉时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the next time you face Amara,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.30,0:29:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会孤身一人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.25,0:29:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.32,0:29:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(关闭  清洁中)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.66,0:29:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.12,0:29:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.92,0:29:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜现在我们只需要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess all we have to do now is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.24,0:29:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.60,0:29:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.57,0:29:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.86,0:29:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.96,0:29:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.09,0:29:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如这真是我在追踪的那个死亡女妖...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this really is the banshee I've been looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.64,0:29:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾琳  以我的经验来看...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen, in my experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.96,0:29:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇并没有人们说得那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge is not all it's cracked up to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.55,0:29:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死这个死亡女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing this banshee
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.43,0:30:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并不能带回你的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not gonna bring your parents back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.21,0:30:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never met them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.33,0:30:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们对于我而言只是几张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just pictures to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.63,0:30:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.20,0:30:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.19,0:30:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.94,0:30:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂的  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.51,0:30:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但复仇之后呢  又该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after you get your revenge, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.97,0:30:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.46,0:30:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈是个律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother was a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.99,0:30:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能追随她的脚步就挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be nice to follow in her footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.46,0:30:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥来找我去复仇时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was studying law at Stanford
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.23,0:30:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在斯坦福读法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}when my brother came and got me so we could get our revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.68,0:30:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你俩从那之后就一直一起猎魔了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been hunting together ever since?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.35,0:30:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没有我哥哥的话我不会干这行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I-I wouldn't do this without my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.11,0:30:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一直都在罩着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had my back every step of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.83,0:30:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算我让他失望时他也如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when I let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.07,0:31:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾琳  这是我哥哥  迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen, this is my brother, Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.95,0:31:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这是艾琳·莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this is Eileen Leahy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.64,0:31:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾琳  很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen, it's good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你也是一个...传人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're a... a legacy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.44,0:31:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess so, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.68,0:31:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, right, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.77,0:31:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.05,0:31:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.96,0:31:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你已经有一把了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm guessing you already have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.73,0:31:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就有多余的一把给穆尔德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, guess we got an extra one for Mildred.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.28,0:31:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穆尔德去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Mildred?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.69,0:31:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.57,0:31:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-真高兴你回来了  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm glad you're back. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.10,0:31:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经觉得安全多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel safer already.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.13,0:31:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来  我想给你看点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.85,0:31:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来坐下嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on and sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.82,0:31:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又不咬人  我一直不太喜欢那套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna bite. Never really was my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.76,0:31:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.35,0:31:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在楼上也能看到同样的景色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the same view from upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.14,0:31:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面西的房间  要额外收费\N{\fnArial\fs30}West-facing rooms, they cost extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.08,0:31:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得为这景色付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you got to pay for the view.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.83,0:32:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.16,0:32:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.04,0:32:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美人  这景色几乎和你一样美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, it's almost as gorgeous as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.75,0:32:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.55,0:32:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你上一次看着落日而不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time you watched a sunset
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.90,0:32:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夜里有什么东西冒出来  是什么时候的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}without waiting for something to go bump in the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.50,0:32:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该找机会试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.73,0:32:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.38,0:32:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望这不会是我最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope this one isn't my last.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.02,0:32:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西真的能起作用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, does this stuff really work?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.49,0:32:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女妖出现...你就把手割破\N{\fnArial\fs30}A banshee shows up and... you cut your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.71,0:32:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按在那些符号上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and slap it on one of those things,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.27,0:32:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后它就被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it gets trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.27,0:32:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的能行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, is this actually something that happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.41,0:32:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.67,0:32:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后它就会挨上一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it gets one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.07,0:32:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穆尔德...一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mildred...everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.58,0:32:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.29,0:32:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.81,0:32:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你退休之前是做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do before you retired?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.33,0:33:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是一支佩茜·克莱恩翻唱乐队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a Patsy Cline tribute band.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.07,0:33:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不会吧  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - I'm deadly serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.28,0:33:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怀念在路上的日子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever miss life on the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.55,0:33:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  我玩够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. Nah, I had my fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.93,0:33:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道快快乐乐长命百岁的秘诀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know the secret to living a long and happy life?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.93,0:33:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还真想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.93,0:33:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟随你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.94,0:33:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后  剩下的一切都会水到渠成\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that, all the rest just figures itself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.89,0:33:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是那样做的  我跟随我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did that. I followed my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.84,0:33:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,环游世界  给人们带来欢笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traveled the world, made people smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.07,0:33:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们暂时忘记烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}forget about their problems for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.92,0:33:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我的心说  "该结束了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then my heart said, "Well, you're done""
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.57,0:33:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我逍遥够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had my fill and...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.09,0:33:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.12,0:33:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.94,0:33:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方并不是我以为的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know, this place isn't what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.32,0:33:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的生活好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, life here is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.54,0:34:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想再多享受享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd just like to enjoy it a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.73,0:34:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会的  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.72,0:34:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的手  还在我膝盖上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hand is still on my knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.74,0:34:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以往上移\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could move it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.19,0:34:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.01,0:34:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真是  我要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.07,0:34:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.04,0:34:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都没听到  你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hear anything. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.73,0:34:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.22,0:34:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.71,0:34:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  亚瑟就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sam, it's what happened to Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.02,0:34:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.57,0:34:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.19,0:34:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  它在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Sam, it's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.34,0:34:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.78,0:35:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.39,0:35:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  停下  -穆尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, stop. - Mildred!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.24,0:35:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.32,0:35:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(符咒)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.56,0:35:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.66,0:36:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.62,0:36:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.81,0:36:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像普通的猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}just another kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.44,0:36:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并没能让我父母活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't bring my parents back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.85,0:36:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.61,0:36:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办  念法学院\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now? Law school?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.67,0:36:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  这是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This is my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.64,0:36:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果需要什么  一定联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to drop a line if you ever need anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.78,0:36:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕只想有人陪陪也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or even if you just want to hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.85,0:36:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不过你不能打电话给我  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't call me, though. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.12,0:36:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以打  但我不会接\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you could call, but I won't answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.94,0:36:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩又要上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you boys hitting the road, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.84,0:36:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.45,0:36:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.21,0:36:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我们之间也没有未来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wouldn't have worked out between us anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.20,0:36:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.73,0:36:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darlin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.66,0:36:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果说这么多年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there's one thing I've learned
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.53,0:37:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在路上学到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}in all my years on the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.43,0:37:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是看得出一个人对另一个人的渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's when somebody's pining for somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.61,0:37:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再想藏着掖着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't try and hide it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.87,0:37:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟随你的心  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow your heart. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.25,0:37:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这位幸运的女士是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who the lucky lady is,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.94,0:37:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我绝对嫉妒她\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am damn sure jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.07,0:37:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我单身  我愿意跟人交往  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm single, and I am ready to mingle, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.08,0:37:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你知道我住哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you know where I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.58,0:37:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.37,0:37:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你们俩乖乖别惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You boys stay out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.98,0:37:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的  穆尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen, Mildred.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.18,0:37:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(他们的背影)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.26,0:37:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(更可爱了)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.51,0:38:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Cass gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.07,0:38:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.67,0:38:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他之前来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he doing here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.88,0:38:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在找有关黑暗的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was looking for lore on the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.92,0:38:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something a little off about him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.36,0:38:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡总是有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something always seems a little bit off about Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.75,0:38:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么近距离面对路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, being so close to Lucifer
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.09,0:38:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能对他来说也很难承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably wasn't easy for him, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.76,0:38:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们盯着点他就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.55,0:38:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.28,0:38:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重新开始工作  挺有帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting back on the job, it... it helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.78,0:38:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  再说一次我说得对那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Say that again. The -- that part about me being right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.44,0:38:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.31,0:38:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.12,0:38:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和路西法在一起时  他\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was with Lucifer, he, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.36,0:38:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他给我看了些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}he showed me things.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.10,0:38:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是我最失败的事情的合辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like a highlight reel of my biggest failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.22,0:38:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他在搅乱你  他就喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he was messing with you. That's what he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.22,0:38:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.85,0:39:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该去找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've looked for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.69,0:39:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在炼狱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were in purgatory, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.51,0:39:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该翻遍每一块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've turned over every stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.98,0:39:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.97,0:39:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直没原谅自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've never forgiven myself for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.46,0:39:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.03,0:39:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我原谅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.26,0:39:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那都是过去的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's in the past, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.39,0:39:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往事已矣\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.25,0:39:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在最重要的  一直以来最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that matters now, all that's ever mattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.06,0:39:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是我们在一起  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that we're together. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.31,0:39:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少废话  喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and drink your beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.93,0:39:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  你今晚能入睡了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You gonna be able to sleep tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.87,0:39:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.53,0:39:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.12,0:39:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我脑子里还有点嗡嗡声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I still got some ringing going in my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.80,0:39:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但听点好音乐就能驱走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing some good music can't wash out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.53,0:39:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.90,0:40:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still can't figure that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.92,0:40:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女妖攻击弱者  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Banshees go after the vulnerable, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.64,0:40:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么攻击你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did it go after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're overthinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.02,0:40:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它是想攻击穆尔德  看到了我的金刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was going after Mildred, it saw my gold blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.07,0:40:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就自我防卫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}acted out of self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.53,0:40:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.34,0:40:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  你可能说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.92,0:40:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我一直都对  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm always right.  - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.49,0:40:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-晚安  -晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Night. - Night.
